<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-26T07:58:07.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:58:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen shot at a student bus in Mexico, killing multiple passengers, and attacked a school bus in Sinaloa, injuring the driver. Federal authorities arrested an alleged cartel leader tied to a deadly car bombing and seized weapons and a stolen truck from Pacific cartel members in Chiapas. A former state attorney general faces treason charges after two CIA agents were killed in northern Mexico, and a Texas man was indicted for supplying firearms to the Sinaloa Cartel. The United States is pressuring Mexico to deliver a security win ahead of the midterm elections. The conflict’s historical toll includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOTjdIdGlNaVdqdTRRRnhVQW03ZXJ2Z2FReU0wcUZSNmdYMG9uUjFUdnl4b2gxaEFhU3BmREJ4eGY3QXAyMzhvMG4zQUlIU3JuWFA0b0owZW02UURLNXFKREw1YXBVcE1fUTlua09CYnVGdURhanJ5eUZKMVFhU2xzclgtZzBCWVJ6MGVaSVhlQmFicWlxUDlwT25JaTVvVEE4Tkdaa1hJeWd5ZGc3UjFETTFOaFgyM2w1OGpkVkMwdGxzcjA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNVEVFQmJseGNjZnVKUGtmRzlmdGRqdHA1Z1Bab1lyVzhEMF94WjN3dzgwR09TSUZ2SENNcmpDVlUyX3FPUkZCM0x2dlI5Q29oQnA5Y3RjU0R6ZHdkYVF1MmxHN01CWklzRHFFS2xqaVZNcEtHN25wRnR2UU5vb2h0cVdZdUNqSVVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOb05RNXRIZ0drSGRRRXBXRjBmNFRUV2tMbUh2RktNa3VXWDNaSVFnVEFpYUtDSTlhY2xrU0tweXcxT3hMVGwwNS1scmE4TmdMT1pucmQ1SkdYdEY0ZDZwaDliZkhuLTZfT0VDLVIyWjBWdXFUeHRGanRTaDBQeUlJUF9oVkJTSkFOMjlzUXRZZFhOcEpPZU52VU1pNVAwY29E?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPUkdCZzVMMUhUWktnTGFHOTNGUm1FQk9xdE9aZWZGbEdQdHVQalB6QzhzeThTMkVfRWZpQVVaWnFmcUR1LW9xalVUNTJRRF9sVXZ4bzhwamVNQUt5OGNQVE45QjhNLVd4VDNFNFF